<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fred Meyer raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fred Meyer raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it raised its rating on Fred Meyer Inc to recommend from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 3/4 at 34-5/8.</p>
</text>
